- PLAN/SPEC https://github.com/Skyline-Gazer/pastebin-worker/issues/83#issuecomment-5599943085
- Patch ID 120-multi-file-directory-zip
- Upstream base 0835cac4ab8f974035d31845f5c2b93b0c85b5c6
